"By default, the commands above will install &ktts; to <filename>/opt/kde3</"
"filename>. If this folder is not in your $<envar>KDEDIRS</envar> path, you "
"may need to add a <userinput>--prefix=<replaceable>target</replaceable></"
"userinput> option. For example,"
msgstr ""

